[{"client_msg_id":"20d5017f-cb9d-4f1e-8061-41ed5ddf15ef","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"なるほど。","ts":"1631275125.195900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5/i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2874a400-f1a5-4330-8399-bbc6221bc86d","type":"message","user":"U02DSF5LU84","text":"すみません。てっきりfbtermのことだと勘違いしてしまいました。\nyaftの方はまだCicaを設定してないです。","ts":"1631274559.195700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8=g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e1876daa-5eb2-41fb-81f6-8fd910b5e331","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"あれyaftはfbtermrcを読み込むの","ts":"1631272864.194200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7skkW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74c191c6-7e2d-468b-9132-73be83841255","type":"message","user":"U02DSF5LU84","text":".fbtermrcに、\n\nfont-names=NotoSansEthiopic, Cica Regular\n\nと書き込んで設定しました。\n始めのNotoSansEthiopicは、最初に指定したフォントにアンチエイリアスが効かないのを対策するためです。","ts":"1631272258.193600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QRI/b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c71ed068-2f38-4698-9c8a-7ffe0af15e7d","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"cicaから使うにはどのように指定しましたか","ts":"1631271904.189900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lwe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f314fad-0c70-4356-948f-e3dfdd01689d","type":"message","user":"U02DSF5LU84","text":"そのような感じらしいです","ts":"1631271734.189500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v70/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"037f86b2-7dd7-4031-b180-4d4fd8a31267","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"コマンドが固定的に読んでくれるということなのかな...?","ts":"1631271653.188900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ByV