:"1631260607.171900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8iBIl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa17991b-c391-4164-a479-8fa803eb5cd3","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"どんな貧弱なマシンやねんといいたくなるな","ts":"1631260575.170900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RNd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e621bd3-5b3f-4a77-b29e-d7bf234b89ca","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"リソースの限られたマシンでは、Xを起動させるだけでリソースを使いきってしまう場合があります。 m","ts":"1631260564.170400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S60+z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0dffa353-acca-433f-be8b-92a675d2527a","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/ebijun/NetBSD/blob/master/Guide/Pkgsrc/mlterm.rst|https://github.com/ebijun/NetBSD/blob/master/Guide/Pkgsrc/mlterm.rst\u003e","ts":"1631260552.169900","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/ebijun/NetBSD/blob/master/Guide/Pkgsrc/mlterm.rst | mlterm.rst\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/ebijun/NetBSD/blob/master/Guide/Pkgsrc/mlterm.rst | mlterm.rst\u003e","text":"```\n.. \n Copyright (c) 2016 Jun Ebihara All rights reserved.\n Redistribution and use in source and binary forms, with or without\n modification, are permitted provided that the following conditions\n are met:\n 1. Redistributions of source code must retain the above copyright\n    notice, this list of conditions and the following disclaimer.\n 2. Redistributions in binary form must reproduce the above copyright\n    notice, this list of conditions and the following disclaimer in the\n    documentation and/or other materials provided with the distribution.\n THIS SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED BY THE AUTHOR ``AS IS'' AND ANY EXPRESS OR\n IMPLIED WARRANTIES, INCLUDING, BUT NOT LIMITED TO, THE IMPLIED WARRANTIES\n OF MERCHANTABILITY AND FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE ARE DISCLAIMED.\n IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHOR BE LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT,\n INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, EXEMPLARY, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES (INCLUDING, BUT\n NOT LIMITED TO, PROCUREMENT OF SUBSTITUTE GOODS OR SERVICES; LOSS OF USE,\n DATA, OR PROFITS; OR BUSINESS INTERRUPTION) HOWEVER CAUSED AND ON ANY\n THEORY OF LIABILITY, WHETHER IN CONTRACT, STRICT LIABILITY, OR TORT\n (INCLUDING NEGLIGENCE OR OTHERWISE) ARISING IN ANY WAY OUT OF THE USE OF\n THIS SOFTWARE, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGE.\n\n\n=========================\nmlterm-fbを使ってみる\n=========================\n\nmlterm\n------------\n\nリソースの限られたマシンでは、Xを起動させるだけでリソースを使いきってしまう場合があります。\nmlterm (pkgsrc/x11/mlterm) [mlterm]_ は、X上で動作する多言語ターミナルエミュレータですが、mlterm-fbを有効にしてコンパイルすると、フレームバッファ上で動作する多言語ターミナルエミュレータとして利用できます。\n\n.. image:: ../Picture/2013/08/02/DSC_2283.jpg\n :width: 800\n\nmlterm-fb向けオプション設定\n------------------------------\n\n/etc/mk.confに、mltermに与えるオプションを指定しておきます。pkgsrc/x11/mlterm以下を利用して、mltermをインストールします。\n\n::\n\n % grep mlterm /etc/mk.conf\n PKG_OPTIONS.mlterm=xft2 mlterm-fb\n # cd /usr/pkgsrc/x11/mlterm\n # make package-install\n # which mlterm-fb\n /usr/pkg/bin/mlterm-fb\n\n起動\n-----------\n\n コンソール画面からmlterm-fbを起動します。\n\n::\n\n % mlterm-fb\n\nPCでのmlterm-fb起動\n-----------------------\n\nNetBSD/i386,amd64でmlterm-fbを利用する場合、起動時にVESAを指定します。 [はよーん]_\n\n#. 起動オプションで5を選択\n#. \u0026gt; プロンプトでvesa を指定\n#. boot\n#. 起動\n#. ログイン\n#. mlterm-fb起動\n\nテスト画像表示\n---------------\n\n mlterm-fbを起動した状態で、catを利用して、画像イメージを表示します。\n\n::\n\n % ftp \u003chttp://mlterm.sourceforge.net/vimperator.six\u003e\n % cat vimperator.six\n\n画像変換方法\n--------------\n\n netpbmをインストールして、以下のコマンドを実行するとsixel形式に変換できます。\n\n::\n\n # cd /usr/pkgsrc/graphics/netpbm;make package-install\n % jpegtopnm aaa.jpg |pnmquant 256 |ppmtosixel \u0026gt; aaa.sixel\n % pngtopnm  aaa.png |pnmquant 256 |ppmtosixel \u0026gt; aaa.sixel\n\nmltermソースからmlterm-fbをコンパイルする\n-------------------------------------------\n\n::\n\n # ./configure --with-gui=xlib,fb\n # make install\n\n回転させて表示\n-----------------\n\nNetBSD/zaurus C1000以降および、NetBSD/hpcarm WS011SHでは、そのまま起動すると、\nmltermが縦画面で起動してしまいます。この場合、mltermに--rotateオプションをつけて起動するか、起動後に$ mlcc rotate_display trueすると回転します。\n。\n.. --rotateオプションの挙動を変更し、--rotate=rightで時計回りに、--rotate=leftで反時計回りに回転します。(WS011SHは反時計回り?)\nこの機能は最新版( \u003chttp://t.co/l52DRJGwGf\u003e )　に追加されています。\n\n\nmltermについて\n-----------------\n\n *\u003chttp://mlterm.sourceforge.net/*\u003e に、より詳しい情報があります。\n\nmlterm-fb上でtwを動かしてみる\n-------------------------------\n\nmlterm-fb上で日本語が表示できたら、tw [tw]_ を利用してツイッターのタイムラインを表示してみましょう。\n\ntwのインストール\n-------------------\n\npkgsrcからtwをインストールします。\n\n::\n\n # cd /usr/pkgsrc/net/ruby-tw\n # make package-install \n\n.. rubic:: \n\n.. [mlterm] mlterm \u003chttp://mlterm.sourceforge.net/\u003e\n.. [tw] tw \u003chttp://shokai.github.io/tw/\u003e\n.. [はよーん] \u003chttp://jnug.net/msg012914ja.html\u003e\n\n\n\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/ebijun/NetBSD|ebijun/NetBSD\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vphsz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"949fb6b6-4992-4d0f-aa09-2da2993334dd","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"うーんなるほど。","ts":"1631260532.169400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FPK0T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"641645c7-39b8-4625-b51b-7eaafa1e18aa","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u003chttps://sourceforge.net/projects/mlterm/\u003e を fb 付きでビルドするといいらしい。こちらは IM にも対応しているとか","ts":"1631260488.169000","attachments":[{"fallback":"SourceForge: mlterm(Multi Lingual TERMinal emulator)","id":1,"title":"mlterm(Multi Lingual TERMinal emulator)","title_link":"https://sourceforge.net/projects/mlterm/","text":"Download mlterm(Multi Lingual TERMinal emulator) for free. mlterm is a multi-lingual terminal emulator , which supports various character sets and encodings in the world.","blocks":null,"service_name":"SourceForge","service_icon":"http://a.fsdn.com/con/img/sandiego/logo-180x180.png","from_url":"https://sourceforge.net/projects/mlterm/","original_url":"https://sourceforge.net/projects/mlterm/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kIvrA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4819bb7-4d93-4a00-8eeb-e75bf39792d6","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"yaftはIMに対応してないのでテキストエディタから日本語入力する必要があるらしい","ts":"1631260439.168000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IDO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19733cdf-1222-4338-aada-aa3d6c305567","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"yaftも開発が止まっている、作者も行方不明と厳しいものがありますね","ts":"1631260414.167300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"569hS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f39eda5-c0aa-4067-947d-c04428006ace","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"fbtermは開発終了","ts":"1631260392.166600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fBir"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9aeddbf-b919-43b4-9365-7d7384dc0632","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"バックグラウンドで起動するvimってfgするまで初期化されていない？","ts":"1631260068.165900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"glSV8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d21a4df-77c2-4f81-865a-4b9fd632354f","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"yaftアップデートが2018年で止まってるのか","ts":"1631259875.165500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gHpO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42278981-7fa0-43d3-ac61-f411f9a620c8","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"速度が変化するならやってみる価値はある","ts":"1631259785.164900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":